{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","hahn-banach-定理","分离","补充定义--definition-supplement"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Hahn–Banach Theorem","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"hahn-banach-定理\"></a></p>\n<h1>Hahn-Banach 定理</h1>\n<p><a id=\"分离\"></a></p>\n<h2>分离</h2>\n<p>我们从最简单的情况开始，怎么把一个点和一个凸集用一个超平面分离？</p>\n<p><a id=\"补充定义--definition-supplement\"></a></p>\n<h2>补充定义 / Definition supplement</h2>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>实线性空间 <span class=\"math inline\">X</span> 上给定次线性泛函（sublinear functional）<span class=\"math inline\">p</span>，子空间 <span class=\"math inline\">M</span> 上线性泛函 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 满足 <span class=\"math inline\">f(x)\\le p(x)</span>，则存在延拓 <span class=\"math inline\">F:X\\to\\mathbb R</span>，使 <span class=\"math inline\">F|_M=f</span> 且 <span class=\"math inline\">F(x)\\le p(x)</span>。赋范空间中的有界线性泛函可保持范数地延拓；这是 Hahn–Banach 定理（Hahn–Banach theorem）。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Hahn–Banach 定理</td>\n<td>Hahn–Banach Theorem</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凸集</td>\n<td>convex set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子空间</td>\n<td>subspace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延拓</td>\n<td>extension</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛函</td>\n<td>functional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性泛函</td>\n<td>linear functional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性空间</td>\n<td>vector space</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范数</td>\n<td>norm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赋范空间</td>\n<td>normed space</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超平面</td>\n<td>hyperplane</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"fa.hahn-banach.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"fa.hahn-banach","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"Hahn–Banach 定理"}],"anchors":["definition","hahn-banach-定理","分离","补充定义--definition-supplement"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition","hahn-banach-定理","分离","补充定义--definition-supplement"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Hahn–Banach Theorem","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"hahn-banach-定理\"></a></p>\n<h1>Hahn-Banach 定理</h1>\n<p><a id=